      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-05-30T19:55:04.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹15.29 (vs ₹11.41 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹15.29 (up from ₹11.41 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹26.5b (up 4.7% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.97b (up 34% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 7.4% (up from 5.8% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 24% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 17% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
